From 0f0bcecae8eed1b8713b4199bc34f248674b37ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Koudai Aono <koxudaxi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 05:05:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 05/9] qwen35: verify mode, several rows in one forward

Multi-row verify on Metal for dense qwen35: the fused GDN front, attention rows with their own key splits, exact and MMA few-row matvecs, commit by recompute, and the session API with the open-verify refusal.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: upstream has a multi-row verify for dense qwen35
Carried-commits: 0b5f915 c7e9af6 dd6ad4f e0fa969 df2fb7e 754c338 46e6192 bc7f488 47d3c3c 5823f98 b3d766f
